{
	"name": "Shared Mind",
	"type": "feat",
	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p>Any effect targeting the mind of a [[lookup @name lowercase]] is partially distributed among other [[lookup @name lowercase]] drones, rendering them immune to the &amp;reference[Charmed apply=false] and &amp;reference[Frightened apply=false] conditions and giving them Resistance to Psychic damage.</p><p>If a [[lookup @name lowercase]] suffers an ongoing effect as a result of failing an Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma &amp;reference[savingthrow]{saving throw}, another [[lookup @name lowercase]] within 30 feet, or the local [[lookup @name lowercase]] commander, can take a Reaction to suffer the effect instead.</p>",
